When starting or restructuring an AI course project, follow the VinUni AI Project skill pack:

`K:\AI_IN_ACTION\vinuni-ai-project-skill\vinuni-ai-project`

Do not code immediately. Ask intake questions, recommend Level 0-4, draft `PROJECT_BRIEF.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `EVALUATION_PLAN.md`, and `IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`, then ask for approval.

Backend and frontend are wrappers. Prioritize agent design, eval cases, logs, worklog, and decision log.
